                {
                  "id": 16,
                  "created": "2018-07-22T21:55:01.306531Z",
                  "updated": "2018-07-22T22:10:26.189915Z",
                  "ref": "~sircmpwn/scdoc#16",
                  "subject": "scdoc 1.4.0 and DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"",
                  "body": "Looks like the version was not stepped for the new tag.\r\n\r\nFrom the build log\r\n\r\n```\r\n>>> scdoc: Unpacking /var/cache/distfiles/scdoc-1.4.0.tar.xz...\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/main.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/main.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/string.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/string.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/utf8_chsize.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/utf8_chsize.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/utf8_decode.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/utf8_decode.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/utf8_encode.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/utf8_encode.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/utf8_fgetch.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/utf8_fgetch.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/utf8_fputch.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/utf8_fputch.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/utf8_size.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/utf8_size.c\r\ngcc -std=c99 -pedantic -c -o .build/util.o -Os -fomit-frame-pointer -g -DVERSION='\"1.3.4\"' -Wall -Wextra -Werror -Wno-unused-parameter -Iinclude src/util.c\r\ngcc -Wl,--as-needed -static -o scdoc .build/main.o .build/string.o .build/utf8_chsize.o .build/utf8_decode.o .build/utf8_encode.o .build/utf8_fgetch.o .build/utf8_fputch.o .build/utf8_size.o .build/util.o\r\n```\r\n\r\nCheck in the Makefile\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n$ head -n 1 src/scdoc-1.4.0/Makefile\r\nVERSION=1.3.4\r\n```",
                  "status": "RESOLVED",
                  "resolution": "FIXED",
                  "submitter": {
                    "canonicalName": "~hrio",
                    "id": 107,
                    "updated": "2018-07-22T17:38:43.458305Z",
                    "username": "hrio",
                    "email": "redacted@example.invalid",
